# Team slugs must match the org exactly (TUDQuant). GitHub silently ignores
# CODEOWNERS entries that reference a team it cannot resolve - there is no
# error, the file just stops doing anything. Verify on the repo's CODEOWNERS
# settings page after any change.
#
# NOTE: this file requests REVIEW, it does not restrict WRITE. GitHub has no
# per-directory write permission. Enforcement comes from branch protection with
# "Require review from Code Owners" enabled - until then this file is advisory.

# The data layer, the pipelines and CI need an infrastructure review.
/tudquant/              @TUDQuant/infrastructure
/data-pipelines/        @TUDQuant/infrastructure
/scripts/               @TUDQuant/infrastructure
/.github/               @TUDQuant/infrastructure
requirements-pinned.txt @TUDQuant/infrastructure
pyproject.toml          @TUDQuant/infrastructure

# Curriculum content is Marven's team and should not wait on infrastructure.
/curriculum/            @TUDQuant/curriculum

# Member strategy work needs no gatekeeper.
/strategies/            @TUDQuant/members
